  "jcr:description": "The Video Image Processing (VIP) Package provides digital image enhancement and automated smoke detection/evacuation to improve surgical visualization. This intelligent technology is designed with Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning concepts in mind, and is intended to improve operational efficiency through automation and customized control for the surgeon and staff.*",
